      "updated": 1786303385857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Line set sleeve through the exterior wall: sloped to drain outward, sealed weather-tight,\nvapor-sealed, and fire-stopped where the wall is rated. NEC 300.7(A) requires sealing where\na raceway passes between spaces at different temperatures - otherwise you condense outdoor\nair inside the room.",
      "originalText": "Line set sleeve through the exterior wall: sloped to drain outward, sealed weather-tight, vapor-sealed, and fire-stopped where the wall is rated. NEC 300.7(A) requires sealing where a raceway passes between spaces at different temperatures - otherwise you condense outdoor air inside the room.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 36,
