      "text": "Oil trap at the base of the suction riser. Without it, oil pools in the riser and the compressor\nstarves - a failure that shows up months later as a warranty argument.",
      "originalText": "Oil trap at the base of the suction riser. Without it, oil pools in the riser and the compressor starves - a failure that shows up months later as a warranty argument.",
