      "text": "Trap the primary drain. An untrapped drain on a negative-pressure pan pulls air instead of\ndraining, and the pan overflows with the drain line completely clear.",
      "originalText": "Trap the primary drain. An untrapped drain on a negative-pressure pan pulls air instead of draining, and the pan overflows with the drain line completely clear.",
